  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLX-1527" textLabel="CPLX-1527" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLX-1527" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="215" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>The Arabidopsis aldehyde oxidase 1 (AO1) was expressed in yeast. Enzyme purification and assay demonstrated its enzyme activity in converting indole-3-acetaldehyde to indole-3-acetate (IAA)|CITS: [10739959]|. The correlation between a higher AO1 enzyme activity level with a increased level of IAA production in an Arabidopsis IAA-overproducing mutant, superroot1 (sur1), suggested the involvement of AO1 in IAA biosynthesis in vivo|CITS: [9489015]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLX-1527" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="AtAO1" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="atAO-1" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="AAO1" />
      <Property key="Synonym_4" value="aldehyde oxidase &amp;alpha;" />
      <Property key="Synonym_5" value="AO&amp;alpha;" />
      <Property key="Synonym_6" value="aldehyde oxidase 1" />
      <Property key="Synonym_7" value="aldehyde oxidase alpha" />
      <Property key="ComplexComponents" value="AT5G20960-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="ComponentCount" value="1" />
      <Property key="IsComplex" value="true" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33519, RXN-33518, RXN-33517, RXN-1829" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="4" />
      <Property key="^coefficient" value="2" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="CPLX-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_10739959" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation__10739959_" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation__9489015_" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_9489015" />
    </Group>
    <Group elementId="CPLX-7097" textLabel="CPLX-7097" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLX-7097" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="295" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis AAO3&lt;/i&gt; gene was expressed in &lt;i&gt;Pichia pastoris&lt;/i&gt;. The homodimeric protein it encodes (AO&amp;delta;) was shown to catalyze the oxidation of a variety of aldehyde into their acid form |CITS:[10972874]|. Importantly, abscisic aldehyde was shown to be a substrate of the enzyme |CITS:[10972874]|. This is in contrast with the other two aldehyde oxidases identified so far: |FRAME:CPLX-7099| and |FRAME:CPLX-1527|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLX-7097" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="AO&amp;delta;" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="AAO3" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="atAO-3" />
      <Property key="ComplexComponents" value="AT2G27150-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="ComponentCount" value="1" />
      <Property key="IsComplex" value="true" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33712, RXN-33711, RXN-12817, RXN-12814" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="4" />
      <Property key="^coefficient" value="2" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="CPLX-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_10972874" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_11050171" />
    </Group>
  </Groups>
